global decDate

on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 11 ............................. <11>
  [  2] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  4] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [  6] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 11 to 1
  [  8] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 10] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 12] get 4 ................................... <the volume of sound 2>
  [ 14] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = the volume of sound 2
  [ 16] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 18] pushint8 100 ............................ <100>
  [ 20] lt ...................................... <volym < 100>
  [ 21] jmpifz [ 51] ............................ repeat while volym < 100
  [ 24] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 26] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 28] add ..................................... <volym + 10>
  [ 29] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = volym + 10
  [ 31] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 33] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 35] pusharglist 1 ........................... <volym>
  [ 37] extcall 73 .............................. <integer(volym)>
  [ 39] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 41] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to integer(volym)
  [ 43] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [ 45] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <6>
